      "captions_zh": "图10 电缆项目的解释路径原图参考。原图来自本地电缆项目报告图3.9，展示前向推理与目标层解释计算；图中的逐位置特征与梯度相乘后跨通道平均对应原项目实现。中文版为原图的翻译适配。本图只作为计算流程参考，不是本项目的手势实验结果。",
      "captions_en": "Figure 10. Original explanation-path diagram from the cable project, reproduced from Figure 3.9 of the local cable-project report. It shows forward inference and explanation computation at the target layer. Element-wise multiplication of features by gradients, followed by averaging across channels, corresponds to the original cable implementation. The Chinese version is a translation adaptation of that original. This figure is a computation-flow reference, not a gesture-experiment result from this project.",
      "caption_zh": "图10 电缆项目的解释路径原图参考。原图来自本地电缆项目报告图3.9，展示前向推理与目标层解释计算；图中的逐位置特征与梯度相乘后跨通道平均对应原项目实现。中文版为原图的翻译适配。本图只作为计算流程参考，不是本项目的手势实验结果。",
      "caption_en": "Figure 10. Original explanation-path diagram from the cable project, reproduced from Figure 3.9 of the local cable-project report. It shows forward inference and explanation computation at the target layer. Element-wise multiplication of features by gradients, followed by averaging across channels, corresponds to the original cable implementation. The Chinese version is a translation adaptation of that original. This figure is a computation-flow reference, not a gesture-experiment result from this project.",
